Looking at this problem, I need to find all functions $f:\mathbb{N}\to\mathbb{N}$ with $f(1)=1$ and $f(n)f(n+2)=f(n+1)^2+1997$.

**Answer Leak Check:** The problem text contains no leaked solutions or proof sketches. Proceeding.

